<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Eletropaulo first-half net falls.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Eletropaulo first-half net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo state power utility Eletropaulo SA on Friday issued the following statement on its first-half results.</p>
<p>			 H1 1997	  H1 1996</p>
<p>    Net		 64.3 million	  131.7 million</p>
<p>    Shr net	   0.00209 real    0.00427 real</p>
<p>    Net revs	  2.277 bln	  2.091 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
